```sql
--Description: 1)  Get the distinct year-month values (yyyy-mm) that exist in ORDER_ITEMS for calendar-year 2019 so we know the periods to analyse.
SELECT DISTINCT 
       TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP("created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY-MM')  AS "year_month"
FROM   THELOOK_ECOMMERCE.THELOOK_ECOMMERCE."ORDER_ITEMS"
WHERE  TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP("created_at"/1000000), 'YYYY') = '2019'
ORDER BY "year_month"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 2)  Look at a few sample ORDER_ITEMS from June-2019 through December-2019 (all statuses kept) to verify date conversion and values.
